title: Start
new-page: true

You woke up in a white, plain concrete room without any distinguishing features. The air permeates a stench of recently-dragged concrete. 

You don't remember why you got here in the first place, in fact, you don't even remember who you are, what you were like and all your past experiences.

- @check-surroundings: You decide to inspect the room.

@check-surroundings

There seems to be a very discreet white door which you have not noticed beforehand. Beyond the white door a lack of temperature seeps through the gaps. The door does not seemed to be locked and is merely standing there because no external horizontal forces have acted upon it as of yet.

-@question: Is it even a door if it is not hinged on either side?

@question

This is besides the point.

You could now make the decision on whether to go through the door or not. (What else could you do anyways?)

-@hallway: You pushed the door open
-@stay: You decided to stay for a little longer


